This product is a derivative work that adapts code from three Apache-2.0
licensed Grafana data source plugins. The adapted areas and their upstreams:

  * Visual query builder — the query model, SQL generation and column
    heuristics (src/data/sqlGenerator.ts, src/data/columnHeuristics.ts,
    src/data/ast.ts, src/data/conditionalAll.ts, src/data/logVolume.ts,
    src/types.ts) and the editor components under
    src/components/queryBuilder/ — adapted from the Official ClickHouse data
    source for Grafana
    (https://github.com/grafana/clickhouse-datasource, Apache-2.0),
    Copyright Grafana Labs.

  * SQL macros and the Monaco completion provider (pkg/macros/,
    src/editor/completionProvider.ts) — adapted from the Amazon Redshift data
    source plugin for Grafana
    (https://github.com/grafana/redshift-datasource, Apache-2.0),
    Copyright Grafana Labs.

  * PostgreSQL wire-protocol connection layer, type converters and dashboard
    ad-hoc filtering (pkg/plugin/, pkg/converters/, src/data/adHocFilter.ts)
    — adapted from the QuestDB Grafana data source plugin
    (https://github.com/questdb/grafana-questdb-datasource, Apache-2.0).

